# Generated agent output (sibling of janitor/, reviewer-review/ above)
connector-health/
# Metabolism Monitor output (findings ephemeral, logbook durable) — local-only, like janitor/
metabolism-monitor/
# Loose session-handoff doc — handoffs/ is already ignored; catch root-level stragglers too
SESSION_HANDOFF_*.md
# Mount-delete workaround holding pen (dupes staged for removal, never published)
quarantine/
# Old physics-explorer candidates (superseded staging copies)
physics_explorer_candidate_*.html
# Heartbeat delivery bundle — distributable artifact, contains a stale explorer.html that clobbers; source is wiki/heartbeat/
