# ISME-2026 talk materials — pre-delivery drafts; publish selectively after the talk, not the working folder
presentation/
# Spent seed scaffolding — approved summaries already live in committed wiki.md; contains destructive one-shot apply_summaries.py (never republish)
sociogram-summaries-review/
# Exploratory team mockups — not yet wired into the explorer
crm-team-mockups/
